    "A successful response confirms backend access, not live market data. Frozen or missing prices can reflect the market session, subscriptions or broker data permissions. Check the quote timestamp and Gateway status before deciding what to restart." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "成功响应只表示后端可访问，并不保证行情实时更新。冻结或缺失的价格可能与交易时段、行情订阅或券商数据权限有关。请先核对报价时间和 Gateway 状态，再判断是否需要重启。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "成功回應只表示後端可訪問，並不保證行情即時更新。凍結或缺失的價格可能與交易時段、行情訂閱或券商資料權限有關。請先核對報價時間和 Gateway 狀態，再判斷是否需要重啟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A writable IB connection is required" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
