        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "需要可交易的 IB 連線"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Above 1 hour, only the primary EMA20 is shown. Applies to all indicators in this chart. Hidden indicators return when you switch to an allowed timeframe. Changes apply immediately and are saved." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "超过 1 小时时仅显示主 EMA20。此设置适用于图表内全部指标；切换到允许的周期后会恢复隐藏的指标。更改立即生效并保存。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "超過 1 小時時僅顯示主 EMA20。此設置適用於圖表內全部指標；切換到允許的週期後會恢復隱藏的指標。更改立即生效並保存。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
