    },
    "IB what-if estimate in USD, not cash collateral. Positive adds required margin; negative reduces it. Changes with account positions and market conditions; no order is submitted." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "IB What-if 美元预估，并非现金担保金额。正数表示增加所需保证金，负数表示减少；会随账户持仓和行情变化，不会提交订单。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "IB What-if 美元預估，並非現金擔保金額。正數表示增加所需保證金，負數表示減少；會隨帳戶持倉和行情變化，不會提交訂單。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "IB-managed and unknown orders are excluded. Stops on the first failure. Cancellation remains pending until IB confirms it." : {
