    "The backend is reachable, but IB requests are busy. Allow automatic retries to back off. If this persists, check Mini and Gateway; this does not by itself mean Gateway disconnected." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可以连接后端，但 IB 请求繁忙。请等待自动刷新退避重试；如果持续出现，请检查 Mini 和 Gateway。这并不直接代表 Gateway 已断开。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可以連接後端，但 IB 請求繁忙。請等待自動刷新退避重試；如果持續出現，請檢查 Mini 和 Gateway。這並不直接代表 Gateway 已斷開。"
          }
        }
