    "IB Paper: Join Bid / Ask submits Entry and the enabled TP / SL exits. Dragging TP / SL sends an amendment on release. New futures brackets keep protection while Trim / Close sends a limit exit at bid / ask; a moving market may leave the exit working." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "IB 模拟盘：Join Bid / Ask 提交开仓单及已开启的 TP / SL。拖动 TP / SL 后松开即提交修改。新建期货附加单在减仓或平仓时保留保护，并按买卖报价提交限价平仓单；行情变动时可能继续挂单等待成交。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "IB 模擬盤：Join Bid / Ask 提交開倉單及已開啓的 TP / SL。拖動 TP / SL 後松開即提交修改。新建期貨附加單在減倉或平倉時保留保護，並按買賣報價提交限價平倉單；行情變動時可能繼續掛單等待成交。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
