    "Defaults for new orders. Existing positions are unchanged; use Manage TP / SL for current protection." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "新订单的默认设置。现有持仓保持不变；调整现有保护请使用管理 TP / SL。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "新訂單的默認設置。現有持倉保持不變；調整現有保護請使用管理 TP / SL。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Profit is the total position amount in contract currency before fees (TP gain / SL loss), rounded to the contract tick. Profit % uses the entry premium before fees." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Profit 为合约币种计价的持仓总盈亏（TP 盈利 / SL 亏损），不含手续费，并按最小跳动取整。Profit % 以未扣手续费的入场权利金计算。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Profit 為合約幣種計價的持倉總盈虧（TP 盈利 / SL 虧損），不含手續費，並按最小跳動取整。Profit % 以未扣手續費的入場權利金計算。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Profit is the total position amount in contract currency before fees: TP gain / SL loss. Targets are rounded to the contract tick." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Profit 为合约币种计价的持仓总盈亏：TP 盈利 / SL 亏损，不含手续费。目标价按最小跳动取整。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Profit 為合約幣種計價的持倉總盈虧：TP 盈利 / SL 虧損，不含手續費。目標價按最小跳動取整。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Enable TP or SL for Bracket" : {
      "localizations" : {
